 title: 'Rush Order Shirts in Las Vegas: What Drives the Speed',
 description:
 'Rush-order custom shirts depend on artwork readiness, blank availability, decoration method, and the shop\'s production queue. Here\'s what actually drives rush speed — and what breaks a rush order.',
 category: 'Operational',
 readTime: '7 min read',
 date: 'May 9, 2026',
 isoDate: '2026-05-09',
 image: '/images/generated/service-screen-printing.jpg',
 slug: 'rush-order-shirts-las-vegas-whats-possible',
}

const faqs = [
 { q: 'What is a rush order for t-shirts?', a: 'A rush order is a custom apparel order produced and delivered faster than the shop\'s standard turnaround. How much faster depends on the quantity, the decoration method, and how much production prep is already done. The best way to know your timeline is to call with your deadline and your artwork.' },
 { q: 'How fast can you get rush shirts in Las Vegas?', a: 'It depends on the drivers, not a fixed number. Small orders with finalized artwork, blanks in stock, and open press time move fastest. Larger runs and new artwork that needs digitizing or color separation take longer. Call with your quantity and deadline and the shop will tell you straight what\'s achievable.' },
 { q: 'What breaks a rush order?', a: 'Five things: artwork that needs revision or digitizing from scratch, blank garments not in stock at the shop or wholesaler, color matching for non-standard pantone colors, embroidery thread not on hand for the colorway needed, and a production queue that\'s already booked. The shop should tell you up front which (if any) of these apply to your specific job.' },
 { q: 'Is RushOrderTees legitimate?', a: 'RushOrderTees (rushordertees.com) is a national online custom apparel retailer that specializes in fast turnaround. They\'re a legitimate operation. Trade-off: they\'re a national online shop, so you\'re shipping from out of state. For Las Vegas buyers needing rush turnaround on local crews, a Vegas commercial shop has an edge on speed simply because there\'s no cross-country shipping.' },
 { q: 'How does RushOrderTees compare for delivery?', a: 'RushOrderTees ships from Pennsylvania, so shipping time from out of state eats into the speed advantage for a Vegas customer. A local Vegas shop with your files on record skips the cross-country leg entirely. Call a local shop with your deadline to compare honestly against any mail-order quote.' },
 { q: 'Can you rush embroidery?', a: 'Yes — embroidery rushes the same way screen printing does, with the same five drivers (artwork readiness, blank availability, color matching, thread availability, queue). New logos require digitizing first, which adds prep time; existing logos with files on record skip that step.' },
 { q: 'Is there a rush order surcharge?', a: 'A rush surcharge may apply, depending on how aggressive the rush is and what production prep has to be expedited. Any surcharge gets quoted up front before you commit — never a surprise on the invoice. Repeat customers with files on record often pay less.' },
]

